  "goodToKnow": "Das Laken is a bed sheet, also das Betttuch or, in the south, das Leintuch. Most German beds use a Spannbettlaken (fitted sheet) and separate duvets for each person, rather than a top sheet; the duvet cover and pillowcase are die Bettwäsche. Das Leichentuch is a shroud. The plural is the same: die Laken."
